游戏开发者早已在无意中搭建了 AI 世界模型的基础架构。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:21:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">39f73a489212a9ee75ea045e93f280518d2ac05a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/ganesh_rajendran_art/game-engines-were-world-models-all-along-1cm4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>LLM 驱动游戏 NPC 的玩家数据隐私考量</title><link>https://dev.to/ally_wang_b2e892e2b0239f6/player-data-privacy-considerations-for-llm-driven-in-game-npcs-4kij</link><description>开放式对话 NPC 会接收玩家自由输入的文本，一旦接上外部大模型服务并涉及日志与跨境传输，隐私合规风险就得在功能上线前先想清楚。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:08:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7115967ce22301468ed31ef8051059a9c671b0ac</guid><source url="https://dev.to/ally_wang_b2e892e2b0239f6/player-data-privacy-considerations-for-llm-driven-in-game-npcs-4kij">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Epic 将在虚幻引擎 6 中移除蓝图，AI 将协助迁移</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/epic-games-to-drop-blueprints-from-unreal-engine-6-as-ai-reshapes-migration-plans</link><description>Epic 确认虚幻引擎 6 将不再支持蓝图可视化脚本与 Actor Gameplay Framework，并表示 AI 会帮助开发者过渡到替代方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:35:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a6fc0d1ba0b7aaec50b7aa619b3ae8b75f408525</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/epic-games-to-drop-blueprints-from-unreal-engine-6-as-ai-reshapes-migration-plans">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>我们的小游戏站赚到了第一笔 7 美分</title><link>https://dev.to/poprecallgames/our-tiny-games-site-earned-its-first-7-cents-2bcb</link><description>作者用纯原生 JavaScript 做了个迷你浏览器游戏合集 Pop Recall，上线两周后收到第一笔 7 美分收入，分享了从零起步的真实账本。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:03:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0b97891aec2640090c6e46ffc13d01174fe3b7ca</guid><source url="https://dev.to/poprecallgames/our-tiny-games-site-earned-its-first-7-cents-2bcb">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>打造游戏可用的虚构军用载具：3D 制作全流程</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/creating-game-ready-fictional-military-vehicle-in-3d</link><description>作者分享原创 8×8 火力支援车 XM-118